ÇTac gia:
Henry David Thoreau sinh nam 1817 va mat nam 1862 - 45 nam mot cuoc doi phong phu, manh me va doc dao. Ong sinh ra trong mot gia dinh binh thuong, tot nghiep dai hoc Harvard nam 1837. Ong nghien cuu khoa hung bien, co dien hoc Hi-La, triet hoc, toan hoc va khoa hoc tu nhien. Trong cuoc doi kha ngan ngui cua minh, ngoai nhung hoat dong khac, ong la nha van, nha tho, nha triet hoc, nha tu nhien hoc, nha trac dac, nha su hoc. Ong de lai hon 20 tap sach, bao, tieu luan, tho. Suot doi minh, Thoreau chong che do no le, cong kich dao luat ve No le bo tron, bao ve thien nhien, len tieng manh me bao ve quyen tu do ca nhan. Ong viet: "Se khong bao gio co mot nha nuoc that su tu do va khai minh cho den khi nha nuoc nhan thuc ca nhan nhu mot quyen luc cao hon va doc lap, tat ca moi quyen luc va quyen uy cua nha nuoc deu tu do ma ra, va doi xu voi ca nhan mot cach tuong ung". Nhieu dong gop cua ong con co gia tri den tan ngay nay: ong viet lich su tu nhien va triet hoc tu nhien, ong di truoc trong nhieu phuong phap va phat hien cua sinh thai hoc va lich su moi truong, hai nguon goc cua chu nghia moi truong hien dai.
Gioi thieu tac pham:
"Walden" la mot hoi tuong day chiem nghiem suy tu ve quang doi "hai nam hai thang hai ngay" song mot minh trong mot manh dat rung ben canh dam Walden, "Giot nuoc cua Troi", "dang yeu hon kim cuong" trong mot ngoi nha tu xay lay, va bang lao dong cua chinh doi tay minh. O Walden, ong da song nhiet thanh say me day tinh thuc "Toi di vao rung boi vi toi muon song thong dong, chi doi dien voi nhung su kien tinh tuy nhat cua cuoc song, va xem thu toi co the hoc duoc nhung gi no phai day toi hay khong, va khong de den khi toi gan chet moi kham pha ra rang minh chua he song". Ong chu truong song don gian vi "Phan lon nhung xa xi va cai duoc goi la tien nghi khong chi khong tuyet doi can thiet, ma con ro rang can tro viec nang cao pham gia con nguoi". Ong mang vao rung giac mo ve mot cuoc song vo uu day vui thu.
Muc luc:
Loi gioi thieu 9
Chuong 1. Kinh te
Chuong 2. Toi Song O Dau va Song Bang Gi
Chuong 3. Doc
Chuong 4. Nhung am thanh
Chuong 5. Co don
Chuong 6. Cac vi khach cua toi
Chuong 7. Ruong dau
Chuong 8. Lang
Chuong 9. Nhung cai dam
Chuong 10. Trai Baker
Chuong 11. Luat toi thuong
Chuong 12. Nhung lang gieng hoang da
Chuong 13. Suoi am ngoi nha
Chuong 14. Nhung cu dan cu & Nhung vi khach mua dong
Chuong 15. Nhung con vat mua dong
Chuong 16. Dam trong mua dong
Chuong 17. Mua Xuan
Chuong 18. Ket luan
Trich dan:
Walden nhan manh tam quan trong cua loi song gian don, tu chu, tram tu, gan gui thien nhien, vuot len tren "sinh ton tuyet vong" nay, von la so menh cua da so nguoi. Trong chuong "Trai Baker" Thoreau ke mot buoi chieu lang thang trong rung, ong gap mua dong va phai vao tru nho can nha toi tam nhech nhac cua John Field, mot ta dien Ai Len khong xu dinh tui nhung can cu lao dong, voi vo va con anh ta. Thoreau thuyet phuc Field hay song don gian nhung doc lap bang cach vao rung de thoat khoi ca chu dat lan chu no, nhung anh chang nguoi Ai Len nay tu choi vi khong sao dut bo duoc nhung khao khat xa hoa va tieng goi cua "giac mo Mi".
(Trich <>, Walden - Mot minh song trong rung, Henry David Thoreau, NXB Tri Thuc 2016)"ä
áPhia Tay khong co gi la (tieng Duc: Im Westen nichts Neues) la mot cuon tieu thuyet viet ve de tai chong chien tranh cua Erich Maria Remarque, mot cuu binh Duc tung tham gia Chien tranh the gioi thu nhat. Tac pham duoc ra mat lan dau vao thang 11 va 12 nam 1928 tren to bao Vossische Zeitung cua Duc va in thanh sach vao thang 1 nam 1929. Tac pham duoc viet duoi dang hoi ky cua mot nguoi linh Duc ke ve cuoc song chien dau va nhung noi kinh hoang ma anh va cac dong doi trai qua trong cac chien hao tai Mat tran phia Tay cua cuoc Chien tranh the gioi thu nhat va duoc xem la mot trong so nhung tac pham hay nhat viet ve thoi ki nay. Chi trong 18 thang dau, tac pham da dat duoc thanh cong vang doi, voi 2,5 trieu ban in bang 25 ngon ngu cua tac pham da duoc ban het.Tieng vang cua cuon sach mo rong den ca hai ben bo Dai Tay Duong, loi cuon nhieu doc gia Duc, Anh, Phap va Hoa Ky. Tham chi, co nguoi con nhin nhan day la mot cuon truyen hay nhat moi thoi dai ve de tai phan chien. Cung voi tieu thuyet Gia tu vu khi cua nha van Hoa Ky Ernest Hemingway, "Phia Tay khong co gi la" cung co the duoc xem nhu hai bo tieu thuyet tieu bieu nhat ve noi dau cua con nguoi thoi Chien tranh the gioi thu nhat. Nam 1930, tac pham tro nen noi tieng hon, khi duoc chuyen the thanh phim cung ten do Lewis Milestone lam dao dien va gianh luon giai Oscar cung nam do. Trong thoi ky Duc Quoc Xa, Adolf Hitler da cam tieu thuyet nay, vi ong nay xem tac pham la mot su "mop meo" hinh anh cua binh linh Duc thoi Dai chien, dong thoi Remarque bi dang quoc xa Duc da kich du doi.
Den nay, voi tinh cam chong chien tranh cua Remarque, thien truyen nay van con pho bien va co suc loi cuon rong rai. Doan cuoi cua truyen, mieu ta ve cai chet cua nhan vat chinh, duoc xem la nhung doan hap dan nhat cua ca tac pham. "Phia Tay khong co gi la" da di vao lich su van chuong the gioi nhu mot trong nhung tac pham ban chay nhat cua chau Au vao the ky thu XX."ã
àTrong con bao tuyet, Ira gap tai nan va mac ket lai. Khong the cu dong, doi va khat, su song dang dan can trong ong, nhung hinh bong ve Ruth, nguoi vo da mat, va nhung ky niem cua hai nguoi da giup ong tiep tuc chien dau.
Cach do vai dam, Sophia gap Luke. Co la sinh vien dai hoc nam cuoi, anh la dau si cuoi bo tot mao hiem, hai con nguoi xuat than hoan toan khac biet khong ngo ca the gioi cua ho dang chuan bi thay doi.
Cau chuyen ve bon con nguoi, hai moi tinh, cach biet nhau bao nam thang nhung dot nhien gap go..."ú
ôTrong doi song han ai cung tung co noi lo lang ve dia vi, co the la noi tu ti ngam ngam hay cam giac thua thiet; co the la su ghen ti hay moi lo bi thien ha coi nhu mot ke that bai. Du xet tren binh dien nao, noi lo au ve dia vi van luon la chu de tuoi moi, khi con nguoi hoai mong va tim kiem cho minh mot cho dung giua dong loai. Con nguoi duong nhu ngay cang nhieu noi lo au hon, kho thoa man hon, bat chap su phat trien nhanh chong cua nen ky nghe va cua xa hoi tieu dung.
De truy tim can nguyen, de Botton su dung lap luan dua tren bon dia hat chinh la Triet hoc, Ton giao, Chinh tri va Nghe thuat, nhung khong vi the ma Noi lo au ve dia vi sa vao kinh vien. Co the khong phai la mot chuyen luan chuan muc va thau dao ve triet hoc hay xa hoi hoc lam vua long cac bac thuc gia dao mao, nhung cuon sach van co the khien doc gia choang ngop voi luong kien thuc do so duoc chuyen tai bang van phong luc trang nha co kinh luc thoi thuong khoi hai.
Bang mot loi nhan dam dam chat de Botton, Noi lo au ve dia vi la mot cuon sach mo ra nhieu cuon sach."®
•Most people have heard of C.G. Jung, often linking him vaguely with Sigmund Freud. Tho the terms 'complex', 'introvert' & 'extrovert' are now used in common speech, few realize they were coined by him. Frieda Fordam's compact, readable study opens with an outline of Jung's psychology & includes chapters on his theories about psychological types, archetypes of the collective unconscious, religion, psychotherapy & dreams & their interpretation. The author also discusses Jung's contribution to education & offers a biographical sketch.--Back cover"Æ
´From the Introduction: "The Harry Potter series may be named after the Boy Who Lived, but if you want to know the story, keep your eyes fixed on Snape. This hook-nosed, greasy-haired, grumpy character is one of J.K. Rowling's enduring gifts to English literature. He's the archetypal ill-tempered teacher: acerbic, yet horribly, deliciously funny. Every time he opens his mouth, he delivers. When he's in a scene, you can't take your eyes off him. Snape is always the story."
In this examination of J.K. Rowling's most enigmatic character, Lorrie Kim shows us how to sort through the illusions and lies to the man who dared to spy on Voldemort, and without whom Harry's story would have turned out very differently. In his final moments, he asks Harry (and the reader) to "look at me." This book does just that."–
ÕDien anh la niem dam me cua Le Hong Lam. Tuy nhien, trong cuon sach nay, dien anh la tam guong ma qua do Le Hong Lam nhin va nghi ve the gioi. Cau chuyen dien anh ma anh dan chung ta vao, do khong chi la cau chuyen ve nhung bo phim va cac nha lam phim cung nhung thanh cong va that bai cua chung, nhung ve dep va chieu sau cua chung: do con la cau chuyen ve xa hoi va ban chat con nguoi.
Neu ban la nguoi yeu dien anh, dung bo qua cuon sach nay. Le Hong Lam se la nguoi ban dong hanh dang tin cay va de men, san sang chia se voi ban kien thuc sau rong cua anh, nhung cam xuc va suy tu sau sac cua anh ve cai dep, ve dao ly, ve pham gia con nguoi, ve nhung day dut tinh than va y chi tu do cua nguoi nghe si dich thuc."	333333@"	R∏ÖÎQ@"	q=
